{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在《在家宴客60道菜》中，熾哥（黃永幟）親自示範了經典小菜「金不換鬼馬牛肉煲」。這道金不換鬼馬牛肉煲巧妙加入了油炸鬼、馬蹄及金不換，令傳統小菜口感極之豐富且香氣濃郁！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f985344a-8b9c-48ff-af32-8a26f4c83f63.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026jJqxN0NHuf1787803707.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f985344a-8b9c-48ff-af32-8a26f4c83f63.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>金不換牛肉煲｜食材清單</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>金不換牛肉煲｜7步做法</strong></p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">處理馬蹄：將馬蹄去皮並切片。</p></li><li></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">處理油條：將油條翻炸至外皮酥脆備用。</p></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4ad722aa-b4aa-43f7-a7cc-45ef11878deb.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026ZOAUfmOf5n1787803712.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4ad722aa-b4aa-43f7-a7cc-45ef11878deb.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>美味貼士</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-06T01:18:20.128677+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}